{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114290","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511429001:0":{"text":"아메스, 방금 어딜 갔던 거야? 짐승이라도 만난 거야?","source_cn":"阿米，你刚才去哪了？是遇到野兽了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5186A76D4D8E3376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511429002:1":{"text":"걱정 마, 두툰. 아무 일도 없었어.","source_cn":"别担心，顿，什么事也没发生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8EC12D2F2137B41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511429003:1":{"text":"숲에서 누가 지나가는 걸 봐서 따라갔던 것뿐이야. 내가 잘못 봤나 봐.","source_cn":"我只是看到树林里有人影一闪而过，所以才追了上去。幸好，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF958F1714C5CB452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511429004:0":{"text":"하지만 방금 비명 소리는...","source_cn":"但刚才的尖叫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x097D166B8A73800A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511429005:1":{"text":"아... 새가 머리 위를 지나가서 놀란 거야. 너무 가까이 날아와서 화살인 줄 알았지 뭐야.","source_cn":"噢……是一只鸟从我头顶上飞过，把我吓了一跳。它离我那么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD4C858162DD7F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511429006:1":{"text":"왜 그래, 두툰? 나 위로라도 해주게?","source_cn":"怎么，顿，你要安慰我一下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x480CE9E4045CC7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511429007:0":{"text":"나, 나는...!","source_cn":"我……我……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61E05EE6943D7DC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1511429007":{"text":"나, 나는...!","source_cn":"我……我……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61E05EE6943D7DC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511429008:1":{"text":"두툰이 아메스 좋아하는 거잖아요. 눈치 좀 챙기시죠.","source_cn":"看不出来？他喜欢阿米。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21CB29A86FBC0282","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"두툰이 아메스 좋아하는 거잖아요. 눈치 좀 챙기시죠.","female":"두툰이 아메스 좋아하는 거잖아요. 눈치 좀 챙기시죠.","variant_male_record_index":"192673","variant_female_record_index":"192674","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511429011:0":{"text":"무사하면 됐어, 얼른 쉬어.","source_cn":"既然没事了，就早点休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3708A53A6B11A2EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511429012:0":{"text":"아... 그래, 쉬어야지!","sou